<title>USA: Teche Holding gets okay for buyback.</title>
<headline>Teche Holding gets okay for buyback.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKLIN, La. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teche Holding Co said on Wednesday it received approval from the U.S. Office of Thrift Supervision to buy back up to 343,750 of its common shares, or 10 percent of the total, in the third year after its mutual-to-stock conversion.</p>
<p>The repurchases would be made in the open market.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
